<given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Giannakopoulou</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Infantile myofibromatosis with visceral involvement and complete spontaneous regression</article-title><source>J Dermatol</source><year>2001</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>379</fpage><lpage>382</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11510506</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>